  "details": "Using FBT + SteamVR\n\nOpen vrc\n\nOpen steamvr overlay (this can be bug 1)\n\nor open SteamVR and then SteamVR Keyboard (bug 2)\n\nBug1: Opening the overlay breaks your avatar, causes it to deform\n\nBug2: Opening the overlay keyboard breaks your avatar, causes it to deform\n\nBoth bugs will fix by closing SteamVR keyboard\n\nThis was only tested using Quest 2, virtual desktop.\n\nHowever this bug is from SteamVR, chances is it will affect any headset using SteamVR",
